Hence, following order is passed:
25-ba2476-2025.doc i) The bail application is allowed;
ii) The applicant is directed to be released on regular bail in connection with Crime Register No.421 of 2025 registered with Kalwa Police Station for offences punishable under Sections 123, 223, 274, 275 of Bhartiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 and under Sections 26, 27, 59, 30(2)(a) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, upon furnishing cash bail in the amount of Rs.15,000/- (Rupees Fifteen Thousand Only).

